BSIM2 AF channel noise spectrum
* Provenance: original Sansho R14 circuit.
* sweep: af .6 1 1.4
.param probe=.6
Vd d 0 1.5
Vg g 0 1.4 ac 1 ac 1
Vb b 0 -.25
M1 d g 0 b dev w=4u l=1.2u
.model dev nmos(level=5 phi=.7 vfb=-.52 k1=.55 tox=.025 mu0=470 ua0=.12 ub0=.02 u10=.1 eta0=.012 vdd=3 temp=27 n0=1.45 xpart=0 k2=.025 kf=1e-24 af={probe})
Hsense out 0 Vd 1k
.noise v(out) Vg dec 4 1 100meg
.end
